    <string name="about_data_7">• A Google account is optional. If you connect one, its cookies stay on this device (encrypted on Android) and are sent only to Google, with Lens requests.</string>
    <string name="about_data_8">• The update check asks GitHub for the list of releases; on-device scanning (the Google build) sends nothing anywhere.</string>
